#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:1
#: 40c939f62f8d41829db64708f78a3c92
msgid "Isaac Scenes and USD"
msgstr "Isaac 场景与 USD"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:3
#: 9d8ea2e8558943d2b6d4ba4f75a6ea48
msgid ""
"Synthetic datagen in this stack is an **Isaac Sim** line. Gazebo is not "
"part of this pipeline."
msgstr "本栈的合成数据采集是 **Isaac Sim** 线路。Gazebo 不在这条流水线里。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:5
#: ec0722bb11244f4cb8a3f51e9fd248c7
msgid ""
"Scene assets live in **FaSim-Isaac**. Robot USD files are the "
"**robot_usds** superproject (FaSim submodule `robots/`). Environment and "
"private project USDs sit beside that tree, not inside it."
msgstr ""
"场景资产在 **FaSim-Isaac**。机器人 USD 是 **robot_usds** 超级仓库（FaSim 子模块 "
"`robots/`）。环境与私有项目 USD 与这棵树并列，不在它内部。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:7
#: f9e5882e71dc4ba081cd9799e8707ea2
msgid "FaSim-Isaac (scene host)"
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac（场景宿主）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:9
#: 731e96e4e7a9474581411811d225b5e4
msgid ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac)"
msgstr ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:11
#: 9e288527209c4be8a3ce22bd90b10a52
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac is the one-click Isaac asset workspace: it clones USD "
"submodules, can install the Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay, and starts Sim. "
"Prefer the scripts; do not hand-assemble the tree."
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac 是一键 Isaac 资产工作区：克隆 USD 子模块、可安装 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay、并启动 "
"Sim。优先用脚本，不要手拼目录树。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:13
#: 6ceedf75aa274db09cf610b968ff37d3
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:20
#: 04e778229c144d29bb8ebb47f80f7d34
msgid "From the FaSim README:"
msgstr "摘自 FaSim README："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:22
#: 3d7aa2598f614de4a89ab979302c9f93
msgid ""
"**`./init.sh` operation 1** — initialize submodules listed in "
"`.gitmodules` / `submodules_visibility.conf`. **public** items are "
"selected by default; **private** items are not (need repo access). Re-"
"runs are additive (`update --init` on the selection)."
msgstr ""
"**`./init.sh` 操作 1** — 初始化 `.gitmodules` / `submodules_visibility.conf` "
"里的子模块。**public** 默认勾选；**private** 默认不勾（需要仓库权限）。重复运行是追加（只对勾选项 `update "
"--init`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:23
#: 47135b57d5b84cf8bc88250800882f9e
msgid ""
"**`./init.sh` operation 2** — optional **Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace**: "
"download matching Isaac ROS workspaces, extract `jazzy_ws` to "
"`isaac_jazzy_ws/`, install rosdep/colcon deps, build, and append "
"`~/.bashrc`. Version menu queries GitHub stable tags; fallback list in "
"`config/fa_sim.conf` currently includes `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`. "
"Override with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**`./init.sh` 操作 2** — 可选 **Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间**：下载匹配的 Isaac ROS "
"workspaces，把 `jazzy_ws` 解到 `isaac_jazzy_ws/`，装 rosdep/colcon 依赖、编译，并写入 "
"`~/.bashrc`。版本菜单查询 GitHub 稳定 tag；`config/fa_sim.conf` 回退列表目前含 `6.0.1` / "
"`6.0.0` / `5.1.0`。可用 `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:24
#: c345e542a0dd44b3a594871314f98ca1
msgid ""
"**`./run.sh`** — start Isaac Sim. Default install path is `ISAACSIM_DIR` "
"(`~/isaacsim` unless you copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`). The menu is PhysX / Newton / Headless "
"Streaming."
msgstr ""
"**`./run.sh`** — 启动 Isaac Sim。默认安装路径是 `ISAACSIM_DIR`（`~/isaacsim`，除非复制 "
"`config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → `config/fa_sim.local.conf`）。菜单为 "
"PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:26
#: 28cd3c468b984950b20970267fbe5f76
msgid ""
"The datagen example README "
"([`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-"
"datagen/examples/IsaacSim/README.md) on `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`) "
"currently lists Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy, and Isaac Sim 6.0. Keep "
"path/version in FaSim config rather than editing launch files by hand."
msgstr ""
"数据采集示例 README（`feature/sim-grasp-datagen` 上的 "
"[`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-"
"datagen/examples/IsaacSim/README.md)）目前写的是 Ubuntu 24.04、ROS 2 Jazzy、Isaac"
" Sim 6.0。路径/版本放在 FaSim 配置里，不要手改 launch。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:28
#: 94645a9f408849b090f3382b2b57923f
msgid "Layout from that README:"
msgstr "该 README 中的布局："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:30
#: 602ea7c064e0449ba26af7f8eba844c2
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── init.sh\n"
"├── run.sh\n"
"├── config/                 # fa_sim.conf + optional fa_sim.local.conf\n"
"├── robots/                 # → robot_usds\n"
"├── environment/\n"
"│   ├── fiveages_env/       # → fiveages-env-usds (public scenes)\n"
"│   └── fa-project-usd/     # → fa-project-usd (private project USD)\n"
"└── isaac_jazzy_ws/         # created by init.sh operation 2"
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── init.sh\n"
"├── run.sh\n"
"├── config/                 # fa_sim.conf + optional fa_sim.local.conf\n"
"├── robots/                 # → robot_usds\n"
"├── environment/\n"
"│   ├── fiveages_env/       # → fiveages-env-usds (public scenes)\n"
"│   └── fa-project-usd/     # → fa-project-usd (private project USD)\n"
"└── isaac_jazzy_ws/         # created by init.sh operation 2"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:42
#: afcd2153c3c744baa84d4e6a91f84035
msgid ""
"Open the target robot USD from `robots/` (robot_usds) in Isaac and run "
"the simulation. Enable Isaac’s ROS 2 simulation-control and prim services"
" as in the [NVIDIA Isaac ROS 2 workspace "
"docs](https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_ros.html"
"#setup-ros-2-workspaces) linked from the example README "
"(`/set_simulation_state`, prim service for object pose)."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac 中打开 `robots/`（robot_usds）里目标机器人 USD 并运行仿真。按示例 README 所链的 [NVIDIA "
"Isaac ROS 2 workspace "
"文档](https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_ros.html"
"#setup-ros-2-workspaces) 启用 ROS 2 simulation-control 与 prim "
"服务（`/set_simulation_state`、物体位姿 prim service）。"

