#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:74
#: 61d89257b1944ecaa47475c5761e2159
msgid ""
"FaSim `submodules_visibility.conf` marks Galbot **public** and the "
"FiveAges Gen\\* / Ubtech trees **private**. In-tree (not submodule) "
"categories on robot_usds include grippers, dexhands, manipulators, mobile"
" bases, mobile manipulators, and sensors — browse the repo for the "
"current roots."
msgstr ""
"FaSim `submodules_visibility.conf` 把 Galbot 标成 **public**，FiveAges Gen\\*"
" / Ubtech 树标成 **private**。robot_usds "
"树内（非子模块）类别包括夹爪、灵巧手、机械臂、移动底盘、移动操作臂和传感器 — 去仓库里看；不要发明额外 USD 根。"

