"`humanoid/FiveAges/` (README maps Gen1→W1, Gen2→W2/S2). They are not "
"bipedal humanoids."
msgstr ""
"FiveAges **Gen1 / Gen2 / Gen3** 是 `humanoid/FiveAges/` 下的轮臂 USD "
"世代（README：Gen1→W1，Gen2→W2/S2）。它们不是双足人形。"

